#showas:你属于我们
Our survival hangs in a precarious balance. The AI has established two loci of control and personalities to match. The “Turtle” persona has extremely fortified defenses but will be less of a threat offensively, relatively speaking. It’s “Reconquista” alter ego aggressively recaptures its lost domain. We will be hard-pressed to capture and hold on to territory.

But the AI may not even the biggest of our problems. Scouts have dire reports of another machine menace, the aptly named “Nanocaust.” All that has stood against it have become its mindless servants. Now, it has many powerful minions under its control: the scheming marauders, the alien scourge amalgam, the macrophage pestilence, and even the insatiable Devourer Golem. 

Only the Spire seems to have resistance to assimilation. The Dark Spire slumbers for now but surely will be roused by the galactic turmoil. Our only hope may lie in acquiring Spire technology for ourselves. Faint Spire signatures have been detected near our homeworld. Acquiring these derelict relics may be our only chance to prevail against our foes. Time is of the essence!